/core/map

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ FacetState is U8

| facet-bound
| facet-owner-missing
| facet-owner-not-class
| facet-owner-generic
| facet-outside-family
| facet-cycle

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ FacetTable

` The facets of a program. Each is the part of a class or of another facet of it its `facet-of`
` names, and has the class at the root of that chain as its owner, and the sibling facets its
` `sees` names. Each class has its facets in the order their properties are laid out and given
` their first values: by the name of the module that declares them, then by declaration. A module
` that declares a facet reaches the private declarations of its owner's module.

+ modules [U32]
+ decls [U32]
+ parents [U32]
+ parent-modules [U32]
+ parent-decls [U32]
+ owner-modules [U32]
+ owner-decls [U32]
+ states [FacetState]
+ sees-starts [U32]
+ sees [U32]
+ class-modules [U32]
+ class-decls [U32]
+ class-starts [U32]
+ class-facets [U32]
+ hosts [U32]
+ places = Map'U64'U32()

────────────────────
+ get count Size

modules.length

────────────────────
+ do index-of U32?
    - module U32
    - decl U32

= places[place-key(module, decl)]

────────────────────
+ do class-range (Size, Size)
    - module U32
    - decl U32

` Where the facets of a class are among `class-facets`, as the start and the end.
for key in 0 .. < class-modules.length
    if class-modules[key] == module && class-decls[key] == decl
        = (class-starts[key] as Size, class-starts[key + 1] as Size)
= (0, 0)

────────────────────
+ do declares-facet-of Bool
    - module U32
    - owner-module U32
    - owner-decl U32

` Whether a module declares a facet of a class.
for facet in 0 .. < modules.length
    . owned = owner-modules[facet] == owner-module && owner-decls[facet] == owner-decl
    =? true if owned && modules[facet] == module
= false

────────────────────
+ do reaches Bool
    - module U32
    - facet U32

` Whether code in a module that declares facets of a class reaches a facet of it: one the module
` declares, an ancestor of one, or one that one of them sees.
. owner-module = owner-modules[facet]
. owner-decl = owner-decls[facet]
for own in 0 .. < modules.length
    if modules[own] == module && owner-modules[own] == owner-module && owner-decls[own] == owner-decl
        =? true if is-within(own as U32, facet)
        for position in sees-starts[own] .. < sees-starts[own + 1]
            =? true if sees[position] == facet
= false

────────────────────
+ do root-of (U32, U32)
    - facet U32

` What a facet's chain of parents ends at, as a module and a declaration, or none for a cycle.
. current = facet
. steps Size = 0
while parents[current] != U32.max
    current = parents[current]
    steps += 1
    =? (U32.max, U32.max) if steps > modules.length
= (parent-modules[current], parent-decls[current])

────────────────────
+ do is-within Bool
    - facet U32
    - ancestor U32

` Whether a facet is another or a part of it, through the facets between them.
. current = facet
. steps Size = 0
while current != U32.max && steps <= modules.length
    =? true if current == ancestor
    current = parents[current]
    steps += 1
= false

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ place-key U64
    - module U32
    - decl U32

((module as U64) /lshift/ 32) /or/ (decl as U64)
